..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : FERTIGUNG.ARCHIVE
.. Autor          : saac
.. Verantwortlich : teamreport
.. Kontrolle      : 
.. Functionality  : Defines parameters to create a document using mask context.
.. xbeauf   = workorder defined in table field banummer the future process
..            document record is linked to
.. ATTENTION: This program must not call fo command .end. Each error handling
..            must take place outside this fop. Example see ev/VORGANG.SPERR
.. Includes       :
.. include fe/WORKORDER.COMMON.ARCHIVE
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue END ? _F|defined(M|banummer)
..
.. Declarations
.type P9:1  xbeauf ? _F|defined(U|xbeauf)
..
.. Table field in infosystem
.copy U|xbeauf = M|banummer
..
.. Details
.input "fe/WORKORDER.COMMON.ARCHIVE"
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
